2. `SUSPENSION GUARD` · level в `tasks.md` · Product + Eng review batch (L2+)
3. Write `plan-<id>.md`: WHAT → Technology axiom → HOW → sunset A/B/C/I → Eng spine → `#qa-consumes` ≥3 TM → Review readiness (no pending Required)
